        <div class="space-y-3">
          
          <details class="group bg-zinc-50 dark:bg-zinc-900/60 border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800 rounded-2xl p-4 transition-all [&_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
            <summary class="flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-zinc-950 dark:text-white cursor-pointer select-none text-sm sm:text-base">
              <span>Apa perbedaan BMR dan TDEE?</span>
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-zinc-400 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform duration-200 shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M19.5 8.25l-7.5 7.5-7.5-7.5" /></svg>
            </summary>
            <p class="mt-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800/80 pt-3">
              BMR (Laju Metabolik Basal) is the baseline calories burned at complete rest to keep organs functioning. TDEE (Total Daily Energy Expenditure) is your actual total daily calorie burn, calculated by multiplying BMR by your Tingkat Aktivitas Fisik (PAL) to account for daily walking, digestion, and exercise.
            </p>
          </details>

          <details class="group bg-zinc-50 dark:bg-zinc-900/60 border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800 rounded-2xl p-4 transition-all [&_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
            <summary class="flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-zinc-950 dark:text-white cursor-pointer select-none text-sm sm:text-base">
