          <details class="group bg-zinc-50 dark:bg-zinc-900/60 border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800 rounded-2xl p-4 transition-all [&_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
            <summary class="flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-zinc-950 dark:text-white cursor-pointer select-none text-sm sm:text-base">
              <span>Berapa defisit kalori aman untuk penurunan lemak berkelanjutan?</span>
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-zinc-400 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform duration-200 shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M19.5 8.25l-7.5 7.5-7.5-7.5" /></svg>
            </summary>
            <p class="mt-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800/80 pt-3">
              Defisit 20% di bawah TDEE (sekitar 400 hingga 500 kkal/hari) optimal. Ini menghasilkan sekitar 0,50 kg (1 lb) penurunan lemak per minggu dengan tetap menjaga massa otot, hormon tiroid, dan laju metabolik.
            </p>
          </details>

          <details class="group bg-zinc-50 dark:bg-zinc-900/60 border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800 rounded-2xl p-4 transition-all [&_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
            <summary class="flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-zinc-950 dark:text-white cursor-pointer select-none text-sm sm:text-base">
              <span>Berapa energi yang dikonsumsi otak manusia setiap hari?</span>
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-zinc-400 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform duration-200 shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M19.5 8.25l-7.5 7.5-7.5-7.5" /></svg>
            </summary>
            <p class="mt-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800/80 pt-3">
              Otak manusia mencakup ~2% massa tubuh tetapi mengonsumsi ~20% Laju Metabolik Basal (BMR) istirahat Anda — sekitar 300 hingga 400 kkal per hari (setara ~100-130 gram glukosa murni) untuk transpor ion neuronal kontinu.
            </p>
          </details>

          <details class="group bg-zinc-50 dark:bg-zinc-900/60 border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800 rounded-2xl p-4 transition-all [&_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
            <summary class="flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-zinc-950 dark:text-white cursor-pointer select-none text-sm sm:text-base">
              <span>Berapa protein harian yang dibutuhkan saat defisit kalori?</span>
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-zinc-400 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform duration-200 shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M19.5 8.25l-7.5 7.5-7.5-7.5" /></svg>
            </summary>
            <p class="mt-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800/80 pt-3">
              Panduan klinis merekomendasikan 1,8 hingga 2,4 gram protein per kilogram berat badan (0,8 hingga 1,1 g/lb). Protein tinggi memanfaatkan Efek Termik Makanan (TEF membakar 20-30% kalori protein), melindungi otot tanpa lemak, dan meningkatkan hormon kenyang seperti GLP-1 dan PYY.
            </p>
          </details>

          <details class="group bg-zinc-50 dark:bg-zinc-900/60 border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800 rounded-2xl p-4 transition-all [&_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
            <summary class="flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-zinc-950 dark:text-white cursor-pointer select-none text-sm sm:text-base">
              <span>Apa itu adaptasi metabolik (mode kelaparan)?</span>
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-zinc-400 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform duration-200 shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M19.5 8.25l-7.5 7.5-7.5-7.5" /></svg>
            </summary>
            <p class="mt-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800/80 pt-3">
              Termogenesis adaptif adalah mekanisme evolusioner di mana tubuh menurunkan aktivitas non-olahraga (NEAT), memperlambat denyut jantung istirahat, dan menurunkan hormon leptin serta tiroid (T3). Untuk mencegah adaptasi metabolik parah, hindari defisit di atas 25% dan selingi jeda diet terstruktur.
            </p>
          </details>

          <details class="group bg-zinc-50 dark:bg-zinc-900/60 border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800 rounded-2xl p-4 transition-all [&_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
            <summary class="flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-zinc-950 dark:text-white cursor-pointer select-none text-sm sm:text-base">
              <span>Bagaimana formula Lemak Tubuh US Navy mengestimasi lemak tubuh?</span>
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-zinc-400 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform duration-200 shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M19.5 8.25l-7.5 7.5-7.5-7.5" /></svg>
            </summary>
            <p class="mt-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800/80 pt-3">
              Formula US Navy memakai rasio lingkar logaritmik leher, pinggang (di pusar), dan pinggul (untuk wanita) terhadap tinggi badan. Memberikan estimasi andal dengan margin galat 3-4% dibanding pemindaian DEXA.
            </p>
          </details>

          <details class="group bg-zinc-50 dark:bg-zinc-900/60 border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800 rounded-2xl p-4 transition-all [&_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
            <summary class="flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-zinc-950 dark:text-white cursor-pointer select-none text-sm sm:text-base">
              <span>Haruskah saya memakan kembali kalori yang terbakar saat olahraga?</span>
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-zinc-400 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform duration-200 shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M19.5 8.25l-7.5 7.5-7.5-7.5" /></svg>
            </summary>
            <p class="mt-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800/80 pt-3">
              Pada kebanyakan kasus, tidak. Pelacak kebugaran melebih-lebihkan pengeluaran kardio sebesar 20% hingga 40%. Karena kalkulasi TDEE sudah memperhitungkan frekuensi latihan mingguan via pengali aktivitas, memakan kembali kalori olahraga hasil pelacakan biasanya menghapus defisit kalori Anda.
            </p>
          </details>

        </div>
      </section>

